  "body": "This beautifully presented duplex offers an impressive sense of space, along with thoughtful extras that set it apart from many similar homes.\r\n\r\nThe sleek, well appointed kitchen sits at the heart of a generous open plan dining and living area. The clever layout creates the feel of two distinct sitting spaces, giving the household different areas to relax and connect. From here, the living extends outdoors to an impressive, enlarged deck - private, sheltered and generously sized for summer barbecues, alfresco dining and gatherings with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThree well proportioned bedrooms provide plenty of room, with the master enjoying its own ensuite and capturing lovely sea views. Two separate toilets add welcome convenience for families and guests, while a heat pump keeps the home comfortable throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nPracticality has also been thoughtfully considered, with internal access garaging and excellent built-in storage in the laundry. The fully fenced grounds provide a secure space for children and pets, without demanding hours of weekend maintenance.\r\n\r\nThe location completes the package. Leave the car at home and walk to the supermarket, shops, cafés and cinema, or take a short trip to beautiful Arkles Bay Beach for a swim, paddle or peaceful walk along the waterfront.\r\n\r\nStill covered by the remaining balance of its 10-year Master Build Guarantee, this is an excellent opportunity for professionals, young families or anyone seeking a spacious, low maintenance home in an exceptionally convenient coastal location.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of indoor space, outdoor entertaining and walkable convenience are difficult to find. Contact us today to arrange your viewing and experience everything this property has to offer.",
